  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       DATA RECORD IS ZDISQ CLEFA.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  ZDISQ  PIC  X(80).  *> SSG-STUB [OUTPUT,1,1,2]
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  CLEFA.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 FILLER PIC X(1).  *> SSG-STUB [KEYIS,1,1,1]
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 CLEF PIC X(1).  *> SSG-STUB [KEYIS,1,1,2]
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 FILLER PIC X(1).  *> SSG-STUB [KEYIS,1,1,3]
