  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 CLEG PIC X(1).  *> SSG-STUB [KEYIS,2,1,2]
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     02 FILLER PIC X(1).  *> SSG-STUB [KEYIS,2,1,3]
