  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT  BDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN  INPUT   DISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL ' ' TO CLEF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ DISQ INTO ZBUF AT END GO TO FBDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD  1  TO  CTR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE  ZBDE  FROM ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO ZBUF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE  CTR  TO  CTR-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO DEBF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CLOS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  BDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  DISQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP  RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FBDE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  'FIN DE FICHIER' UPON  CONSOLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE   CTR   TO CTR-1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  MES1   UPON  CONSOLE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO  CLOS.
</DATA>
